1
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:05,053
I got tired of this.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,070
So I combined three of my projects to automate my job search.

3
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:11,797
Aria, run the job pipeline.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,590
Every 24 hours, Aria fills the new postings. Best fit first.

5
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:21,093
Coldstart finds the right person to email.

6
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:24,357
And drafts it. Never sent without me.

7
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:28,643
And every AI call goes through GateLLM. Cheapest model first.

8
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:33,853
Everything waits for me. Drafts in my inbox. Filled tabs in my browser.

9
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:39,363
Same 87 tasks. Claude: $3.01. GateLLM: $0.21.

10
00:00:39,567 --> 00:00:40,667
It never submits.

11
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:41,427
I do.
